{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "182cf910b8be7e51ddad127b903dd1a1da48ba9c9a2d1358e15df7c975f77851", "ja": "まさかの結婚！？", "zh": "竟然要结婚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "818263de08753b3515d4c38054aae48d4a2845b6186dbe26561e074cda3dd87c", "ja": "プロデューサーが結婚する！？そんな誤解を\n招いたのは仕事のために用意された結婚式場\nのパンフレットの山々だった。若い人向けの\nブライダル企画に向けて、アイドルたちは\nそれぞれ、結婚式について思いを馳せる。", "zh": "制作人要结婚了！？引发这种误会的  \n竟是为工作准备的一摞摞婚礼会场宣传册。为了面向年轻人的  \n婚礼企划，偶像们  \n分别开始畅想起婚礼来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31aca539f3a4c1e161f6cc459779f86ca413c2d542ff036f7f17f399f5478418", "ja": "（先方との打ち合わせによりメンバーも確定した。\n早速みんなを召集してミーティングといこう！）", "zh": "（和对方商量后，参加的成员也确定下来了。马上把大家召集起来开个会吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b50d74f6af7cca2766cca7d7f2ba4f1d11c9ab0be0a76f0cc6b9ceb5bf5220b9", "ja": "今からミーティングみたいやけど……\n机の上がえらいごちゃついとるなぁ。", "zh": "听说现在要开会了……\n不过桌上可真是乱糟糟的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "29c5f4952bba486f3e8f02e6880aa54a6a0528feb35b6d2a292fb3aca6b2050b", "ja": "華やかなウェディングドレスのカタログ、\n見ているだけで幸せな気分になりますね～。", "zh": "华丽的婚纱目录，光是看着就觉得好幸福哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c92101624ca375e96ee7971d4a1c7da777e345f6baaa3c115f7fb1d209e2373", "ja": "あ、『ハピマリ』もあるよ！　ふーちゃんたちが\nCMソングを歌ってたよね！　素敵だったな～♪", "zh": "啊，《ハピマリ》也有哦！风花她们还唱过广告歌呢！真的很棒呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "c1ea2b47ae53a0953a63e982444b060882d137710482f9ed72a6ea076bd68675", "ja": "よく覚えています。ウェディングドレス姿での、\nグラビアもありました。……憧れ、だぞ。", "zh": "我记得很清楚。还有穿着婚纱拍摄的\n写真。……真让人向往呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "9f39b30afa217f1d206c0df7fcc685819675441b8c37343ab3e91df4d5c70217", "ja": "ミーティングにこれが用意されてるってことは、\n自分たちの次のお仕事は、ブライダル関係なの？", "zh": "既然会议上准备了这个，那我们接下来的工作是和婚礼有关的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "74618f6942990041f67c85a3fc32ad498a21895a23ff04c93ba6242928111140", "ja": "そんなんありえへんて！\n私たちまだ高校生なんやから。", "zh": "怎么可能嘛！\n我们还都是高中生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "f387440bd9ed394f68b4f0d670a0df490128200a143ef9dca328c46ddc028a5f", "ja": "それじゃあ……{$P$}が\n結婚する、とか！？", "zh": "那就是说……{$P$}要结婚了之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "af2f0803cac667ddc494b1dc5869e9805fd65cee3417f7d5d537dc37cc51abaa", "ja": "だから、ここに置いてあるのかなって。\n結婚式場のパンフレットとかもあるし……。", "zh": "所以我才在想，是不是放在这里的。\n这里还有婚礼会场的宣传册什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "e47765356fdf4504f1c64a0dba2287fc2fd0fcec83ace264cb884b1e3b9d0bc0", "ja": "まさか……いや、でもそうやんな……。\n導き出される答えはひとつかもしれへん……！", "zh": "难道说……不，不过，确实有可能……\n这样推导出来的答案，或许只有一个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "2050a16a67e1464171ff6e6120f01c0b65bc336b138dcbf47ec56b962a630452", "ja": "そうですね～。けど、{$P$}さんの\n話を聞いてからでも、遅くはないかと～。", "zh": "是啊～不过，听听{$P$}先生怎么说之后再做决定，也不迟吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "7fa233241c7e37188c39cb8db8641edb17b0177bb4c79e2f14c28e4c00a64984", "ja": "そうですね。結論を出すには、まだ早いかと。\n……へいこ……へいど……平常心だぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "是啊。现在下结论，还为时过早。  \n……平常……平静……要保持平常心，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "227d6a27975030e95b897c0297ae73071e6e25e70489b3dbce9f2121d70a6a8d", "ja": "じゃあ、{$P$}が入ってきたら、\nお祝いの言葉をかけるだけにしとこっか！", "zh": "那，等{$P$}进来后，我们就只说几句祝福的话吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "6e5832a01052aa52c6469d6ca26388ac8b4b1adfc0e2f762fbe7641534a97549", "ja": "せ、せやな！　こういう場合、\nそれぐらいはするもんかもしれへんな……！？", "zh": "是、是啊！这种时候，或许至少也该说几句祝福的话吧……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "5edc205749ef06e15582b6e219ff7347a89f67d2d7dd53869eff32ff2fd12b83", "ja": "そ、そうなの？　お祝いの言葉……\n急に言われても、自分、思い浮かばないぞ～！？", "zh": "是、是这样的吗？祝福的话……\n突然让我说，我可想不出来啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1019_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ea28c5c30626e945d5c5693cff3de48efb848f7c7dec37818dcda2d2ff9d376e", "ja": "みんな、遅くなってすまない！\n前の会議がものすごく押しちゃって……。", "zh": "大家，抱歉来晚了！\n之前的会议拖得实在太久了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "8b1e6cea3d16e5e19acb4a66f92b7fdb05dfdcd693da61f221243d648f984acc", "ja": "あっ、もう来ちゃったの！？\n早すぎるぞ{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，已经到了吗！？也太早了吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f438a7127093f6a57343b698cc637770f08334febba105739bf8ae7e971a482f", "ja": "え？\nいや、むしろ遅刻してたと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "诶？\n不，我倒觉得自己已经迟到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "429f08737500d8eb6f83bd5f54a025e6a56f87f6e9e2821d8584d16be124955d", "ja": "{$P$}、あのね！\n……。………………。", "zh": "{$P$}，那个啊！\n……。………………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "c7011f3b36669d6142b9399624af49a194d689dcb8421a75ed9f561c47660604", "ja": "あれ？　顔見たら、言おうと思ってた言葉が\n飛んじゃった？　なんでだろ……？", "zh": "奇怪？看到你的脸之后，原本想说的话\n怎么一下子全忘了？为什么会这样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "f856e0320a0561cb34e85d78f52654305bb7e8a0f3be5f345d0d4144ddf5e717", "ja": "{$P$}さん、急やねんて！\n私も考えてたこと忘れてもうたやん！　もう！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你也太突然了吧！\n连我刚才想的事情都忘了！真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e090a2b5927637c8ba27a081f1bb07070199aa795bb6acb8b6d2fcbec314f8be", "ja": "？？？　みんな、何の話をしてるのか\n説明してくれないか……？", "zh": "？？？　大家能不能给我解释一下，你们在说什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1027_null", "source_sha256": "cd477a1e88bfecfe5999e88262eb118a9354bfa3b269d5c96e5bd4fcaa8dc7eb", "ja": "説明中……", "zh": "说明中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "2d3d3326fb14de249bdae60daca224be240eaf692ef41a142e4763e1474a5c65", "ja": "若い人向けのブライダル企画……？\n結婚式場からのオファーで？", "zh": "面向年轻人的婚礼企划……？是婚礼会场发来的邀约？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "ccd939305b9e8067bfd100672deec75d668168b97670d046cbca2b03862eb810", "ja": "な～んや！　それならこのパンフレットとかは、\n本当にミーティングの資料ってことなんですね！", "zh": "原来如此！那就是说，这些宣传册之类的，真的是会议资料喽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "0ded4d5b6984d54be9de9910d8a54e3fa98b0fa987ab0443f3887ab10db687d2", "ja": "うん。これは俺のプライベートとは\n全く関係ない、仕事の資料だよ。", "zh": "嗯。这和我个人的私生活\n毫无关系，是工作的资料哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "917f3ba7a82aa04e9c4d01cad66e76d28dcd54387dc9ffda2fb4ea6e85a939ac", "ja": "そうだったんですね～。\nやはり、話を聞いてみて正解でしたな～。", "zh": "原来是这样啊～。果然，听您讲讲是对的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "0ed0e8cbf661ad139828c982475c43a37ff8cd70975586d481d154d702e7ffe4", "ja": "はい。さっきまで、心臓が飛び出しそうでしたが、\nようやく落ち着きました。……ほっ。", "zh": "是的。刚才心脏都快跳出来了，不过总算冷静下来了。……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "80cde2130221160b6f3c65280dfc5a3ecaf6ceaad7bf331ef7e5b2c83012d0be", "ja": "紛らわしくてすまなかった。みんなのテンションが\n少しでも上がればと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "让你们误会了，真是抱歉。我只是想着，哪怕能让大家\n稍微打起点精神来就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "b4fd3d7a1f2484438834bb3f73c26e91482aa53b40887633864d397735c9a08d", "ja": "大丈夫！　みんなのテンションは、\nバッチリ上がったと思う！", "zh": "没关系的！我觉得大家的情绪，\n都完完全全调动起来了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "0f42a53bc023f59ae9aaedb19a124da8f19f1464ee6e0effe91e1316642e4a51", "ja": "はい～。華やかな資料は、見ているだけでも\n楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "是的～。光彩夺目的资料，光是看着就觉得很开心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "7deffca5d5185b86f02dd6dcdc9e188517143dfedc8e4ac8604f87cbeea885f0", "ja": "私も、もしこれが自分ならどんなふうになるのかと、\n色々想像してしまいました。", "zh": "我也不禁想象了起来，如果这是我自己的话，会变成什么样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "276b50d4c3f13e772e9426f704680e54f52e593e1658c9ace7bb784519d462dd", "ja": "そういう想像力は、とても大事だと思う。\n理想や憧れを、うんと語ってほしいからな。", "zh": "我觉得这样的想象力非常重要。\n因为我希望你能尽情谈谈自己的理想和憧憬。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "e4bf15c42e7f8c60d9c4ab4be2955a03aab4469e20128c0a40c80c8af9fc3cd7", "ja": "今回は他のアイドルもグラビア参加があるけど、\nみんなには新曲とPVで頑張ってもらいたい！", "zh": "这次也有其他偶像参加写真拍摄，不过还是希望大家在新歌和PV上多多努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "89d5ecefdd7a464f302d16d626bb4698d29376b02ebd3b03aebb8a0392980364", "ja": "……というのは、あくまで俺の希望だ。\nみんなの感触としては、どうだろう？", "zh": "……这也只是我个人的期望。\n大家对此感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "2115022faa09b65704f10011103eab72446a3b277fbde243b04686f53d12eb48", "ja": "当然OKです！　ティーン代表として、\nなにより関西代表として、やりきってみせます！", "zh": "当然没问题！作为青少年代表，\n更作为关西代表，我一定会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "231538e04cee00452ee8ea3a2a1fbdf20b2fc553a653af818049a36b29683387", "ja": "そしたら自分は、沖縄代表だね！　沖縄の式は、\n親戚いっぱい呼んで、盛大にやるのが決まりさー！", "zh": "那我就是冲绳代表啦！冲绳的婚礼，按规矩要请来一大帮亲戚，热热闹闹地举办才行啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "e9062503c57674d545118c05e4b6a1c5d9338c87a882d4190a2cc6f62e81d996", "ja": "へえ～、にぎやかなんだね！　私だったら\n100mヴァージンロード走、全力で駆け抜けるよ☆", "zh": "哇～，原来这么热闹啊！要是我的话，就会全力冲过100m的婚礼走廊赛道哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "28e7bcdabd8f3f2bb2213104097985cacf44a02c43ad7516f7c14411844d26b8", "ja": "海美ちゃんらしいですな～。私も、いつかそういう日が\n来るかもしれませんし。しっかり取り組みますよ～。", "zh": "很有海美的风格呢～。我说不定也会有那么一天。所以，我也会好好准备的哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1044_044miz", "source_sha256": "47a52cc1e1f3a285fb40e67995e4e702e84cff544df28e7e9d4dc00e38ab4e1c", "ja": "はい。いつその時が来るか、誰にもわかりませんから。\n……備えあれば憂いなし、だぞ。", "zh": "是的。谁也不知道那一刻什么时候会到来。\n……有备无患嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0288_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0288_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "4735b8fd991e258159ec83fe6a395a0e45aa01d99605d273b1f486dae7152492", "ja": "（みんな、前向きに捉えてくれているみたいだ。\nティーンならではの想像力、大いに発揮してもらおう）", "zh": "（大家好像都在积极地看待这件事。就让她们充分发挥少女特有的想象力吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
